WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.741
Promoted to architect

00:00:01.647 --> 00:00:02.602
never told

00:00:03.126 --> 00:00:04.069
The post argues

00:00:03.881 --> 00:00:04.989
developers are being

00:00:04.801 --> 00:00:06.215
promoted into architect

00:00:06.027 --> 00:00:07.111
roles without being

00:00:06.923 --> 00:00:07.677
informed

00:00:07.819 --> 00:00:08.609
and without the

00:00:08.421 --> 00:00:10.225
expectations or support

00:00:10.036 --> 00:00:11.180
changing to match

00:00:11.710 --> 00:00:12.559
It opens with

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:13.632
a debugging story

00:00:13.809 --> 00:00:15.070
a colleague vibe-coded

00:00:14.882 --> 00:00:15.707
the logging in

00:00:15.519 --> 00:00:16.485
a Google Forms

00:00:16.309 --> 00:00:17.004
add-on

00:00:17.194 --> 00:00:17.960
and the welcome

00:00:17.771 --> 00:00:19.528
screen took 15 seconds

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:20.047
to load

00:00:20.582 --> 00:00:21.607
The logging ran

00:00:21.419 --> 00:00:22.539
first after every

00:00:22.351 --> 00:00:23.082
install

00:00:23.247 --> 00:00:24.190
yet Google has

00:00:24.002 --> 00:00:25.251
severely restricted

00:00:25.063 --> 00:00:26.148
how much detail

00:00:25.959 --> 00:00:26.879
it can return

00:00:26.691 --> 00:00:28.058
since last December

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:29.604
Full story on

00:00:29.415 --> 00:00:30.311
the dashboard
